	(text "RP2350 debug interfaces. Unless severely space \nconstrained, you should add at least *one* debug\ninterface. For a dev board, consider using \nthe Femtoprobe, since that hooks in to the \nAPEC SoM USB hub for easy debugging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 141.478 543.052 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5cd2cd67-b9ee-4a9e-a5c3-ea42c5f01dd1")
	)
	(text "A second QWIIC port on the same bus however doesn't require additional pull-ups."
